# No API key is needed. Every command works keyless: the CLI gathers Yahoo data and the
# Claude desktop / Claude Code session writes the TradingAgents analysis with its own connectors.

# Optional: where results, replay files and the memory log live (default ~/.ta-claude)
# TA_CLAUDE_HOME=

# Optional: override the training cutoff used by the backtest guard (YYYY-MM-DD)
# TA_MODEL_CUTOFF=

# Optional and unused by default: only set this if you ever want the separate paid
# multi-agent pipeline. Leave it empty for keyless use.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# TA_DEEP_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# TA_QUICK_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
